  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So I know we are able to put the drops in a specific place but I was hoping maybe an option where once it gets dropped on the floor it will stay there until it is found instead of it going to the closest person automatically. A lot of people are interested in having little hunts within their groups where they place them down in hidden spots and let people go out and find them. It could bring a lot more opportunities and fun experiences when giving away VRC+ to other users.",
